WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:12.100
Go to Gojoline and press Start free.

2
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.800
Sign in with your phone or email. We send you a 6-digit code.

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.500
You're in. Every new site starts here.

4
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:29.600
Describe your business: services, prices, hours, contact.

5
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.300
Choose the site language (Both = Amharic and English), then start.

6
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:43.420
Gojoline plans your pages and writes your site. About a minute.

7
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:48.520
Your site is ready to check.

8
00:00:50.320 --> 00:01:06.420
Computer view: scroll through your whole site.

9
00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:20.820
Phone view: what most of your customers will see.

10
00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:29.380
Type a change in the chat, in your own words.

11
00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:39.380
Done: softer pink. The preview updates by itself.

12
00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:48.680
Bigger changes, like a new section, ask you first.

13
00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:57.250
Adding a bridal packages section with prices.

14
00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:10.050
The new section is on your site.

15
00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:23.350
Open Photos, upload a picture, then press Use in my site.

16
00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:27.280
Say where it should go, and send.

17
00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:34.380
Your photo is now the big picture at the top.

18
00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:54.580
Every change is saved. Press Bring back to go to an earlier one.

19
00:02:54.580 --> 00:03:02.930
Changed your mind? Bring the newer version back the same way.

20
00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:09.230
Press Publish and choose your site's address.

21
00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:13.330
Gojoline checks your site and puts it online.

22
00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:19.430
Your site is live. Share the link with your customers.

23
00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:29.430
This is your live site, as customers see it.

24
00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:39.030
A customer books an appointment...

25
00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:49.930
Your dashboard: open, share, or print a QR code poster.

26
00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:55.130
Bookings arrive in Messages. Reply, then mark it replied.

27
00:03:55.130 --> 00:04:09.430
{tabInfo}: phone, hours, Closed today and a top banner.

28
00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:13.230
{settings}: connect Telegram to get every booking on your phone.

29
00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:27.430
Plan and payments: your changes left, and the plans.

30
00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:37.530
Pay in 3 steps, with Telebirr or a bank transfer.

31
00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.130
Add the transaction number and a receipt photo, then send.

32
00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:45.130
Need help? Send feedback any time.
